# Results are committed because the scorecards and their raw evidence are the
# showcase. Two kinds of output stay ignored:
#
#   configs/  — generated client config files and per-run output scratch.
#               They contain absolute paths to this machine and are regenerated
#               on every run, so they carry no value and would create noise.
#
# Everything else under results/ (scorecard.json, scorecard.md, raw/, and the
# top-level comparison.md) is evidence of a real run and is committed.

configs/
*/configs/
selftest/
